  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read `notes/w5-ai-coordination.md` + `EventRulesService.cs` — confirm `FireAsync` signature, the gate set (cost cap, opt-out, explicit-command supersede, M4 confidence), and the seam for firing.</step>
    <step order="2">Run `/conflict-check` scoped to `Services/Ai/`.</step>
    <step order="3">Read task 010's `ICommunicationEnrichmentService` to locate the Responsive-Intelligence trigger point where `communication_assessed` should fire.</step>
    <step order="4">Wire the trigger: on assessment completion, call `EventRulesService.FireAsync("communication_assessed")` (via the agreed seam) with the assessment payload (category, urgency, confidence, matter/regarding context, privilege flag).</step>
    <step order="5">Confirm the ordered Bindings/Actions route through OutputRouter's `record`/`notification` legs (task 051) to `CreateEvent`/`CreateTask`/`CreateNotification`; add any missing plumbing so the executors receive the correct payload.</step>
    <step order="6">Verify the existing gates fire unchanged (cost cap, opt-out, explicit-command supersede, M4 confidence) — reuse, do not duplicate. Ensure privilege is passed as a flag only (ADR-015).</step>
    <step order="7">Wrap the fan-out best-effort/non-fatal (NFR-06): failures log + continue, never fail enrichment/send/inbound.</step>
    <step order="8">Add/update tests in `tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/`: fire → gate enforcement → CreateEvent/Task/Notification produced; non-fatal on executor failure; privilege flagged-not-decided (deeper end-to-end fan-out + gate tests are task 054).</step>
    <step order="9">Run `dotnet build` + `dotnet test --filter EventRules`; then `dotnet publish -c Release ... -o deploy/api-publish/` (report size + delta vs ~49.63 MB) + `dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive` (no new HIGH CVE).</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: `code-review` on the diff; `adr-check` against `spec.md` (ADR-013/015/032; NFR-06). Address Critical findings. `/conflict-check` clean before PR.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`: mark 052 ✅; confirm 054 unblocked (needs 052+053). Update `current-task.md` (record the fire seam + gate reuse; advance).</step>
  </steps>

